Package: timemoir
Type: Package
Title: Low Level Benchmarking Framework for Memory, CPU and Execution Time in R
Version: 0.8.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Nicolas",
           family = "Chuche",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "nicolas.chuche@barna.be")
           )
Description: Provides a benchmarking framework for profiling memory usage and
  execution time of R functions. It allows users to run long-running functions
  in the background and collect detailed metrics at OS level on memory
  consumption. The results include the duration, start memory, maximum memory
  usage, cpu usage and any errors encountered during execution. This framework is
  particularly useful for functions that cannot be easily benchmarked using
  traditional profiling methods, like those that rely on disk I/O or in memory
  database queries.
